This software incorporates mathematical models and formulations:
- Blackbody color temperature approximation based on the Planckian locus 
  and public domain formulation by Tanner Helland (2012).
- Windows Desktop Window Manager (DWM) composition interfaces via the 
  documented Windows Magnification and GDI APIs.
